  }

  component "==nyx-physics\n<size:16>[Container: Rust library]</size>\n\nThe Physics trait, the problem envelope (ProblemSpec), descriptors, SolveResult, the registry type, validation, JSON Schemas." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXIsTGlicmFyeQ==>> as nyx.nyxphysics
